WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.497 --> 00:00:02.231
(upbeat music)

00:00:02.231 --> 00:00:04.398
(screams)

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:09.500
- Go big or go home, right?

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:12.410
- I literally get hives
every time you say that.

00:00:12.410 --> 00:00:15.740
- It's not a dream, it's reality.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:19.520
- This is a special chicken,
this is a magical chicken.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:20.353
- Come on.

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:22.520
(screams)

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:27.870
- We're bringing back the Glee club.

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:30.610
- You two have just entered Thunder dome.

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:33.090
You will beg for death.

00:00:33.090 --> 00:00:34.870
- Here, get out of the booth,
take all your clothes off

00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:36.110
and fold yourself twelve times.

00:00:36.110 --> 00:00:36.943
- You got it.

00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:40.180
- Six folds huh?

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:42.630
What do you guys got me in a series 9000?

00:00:42.630 --> 00:00:44.010
You cheap insect (beep) didn't think

00:00:44.010 --> 00:00:45.777
I was worth your best equipment?

00:00:55.665 --> 00:00:56.850
(glass breaks)

00:00:56.850 --> 00:00:57.770
- Jesus!

00:00:57.770 --> 00:00:58.883
- Not quite.

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.285
- This is not who you are.

00:01:02.285 --> 00:01:03.180
- I'm the devil.

00:01:03.180 --> 00:01:05.460
- Friends, family, dog.

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:08.040
- I just wanna be married again.

00:01:08.040 --> 00:01:10.250
- And I just want a million dollars.

00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:12.010
- So how much do you think
I can get for my kidney?

00:01:12.010 --> 00:01:12.920
- What are you doing here?

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:14.920
I thought tonight was your
big anniversary dinner.

00:01:14.920 --> 00:01:17.170
- Yeah a little change of plans.

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:18.890
We're gonna break up instead.

00:01:18.890 --> 00:01:21.130
- If you're watching this
then I'm not around anymore

00:01:21.130 --> 00:01:24.380
but don't spiral, don't
obsess, keep going.

00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:25.740
I thought I'd leave you a little guide

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:27.120
to life without me.

00:01:27.120 --> 00:01:29.420
You're lovely but you're
absolutely useless.

00:01:29.420 --> 00:01:31.963
You know how grumpy you get
when things don't go your way.

00:01:31.963 --> 00:01:33.963
But you got such a good
heart, you're born like it.

00:01:33.963 --> 00:01:35.583
You just decent.

00:01:35.583 --> 00:01:37.180
- It's just gone.

00:01:37.180 --> 00:01:39.770
Everything we said, everything we did.

00:01:39.770 --> 00:01:41.663
I feel like I've been erased.

00:01:43.420 --> 00:01:46.260
- Let's not over complicate
matters unnecessarily.

00:01:46.260 --> 00:01:47.600
- My name is Elizabeth.

00:01:47.600 --> 00:01:49.000
- Long live Queen Elizabeth.

00:01:50.160 --> 00:01:51.770
- Be firm, just lay down the law.

00:01:51.770 --> 00:01:53.722
I know he's Winston Churchill and all that

00:01:53.722 --> 00:01:56.760
but remember who you are,
you're the queen of England.

00:01:56.760 --> 00:02:00.193
- The crown must always win.

00:02:02.290 --> 00:02:04.490
- It's okay mom it's okay
the bullets can't get through

00:02:04.490 --> 00:02:06.401
the armor griding

00:02:06.401 --> 00:02:08.150
Mom I need to get you to safety.

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:09.893
Mom this is what I do, trust me.

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:20.630
- We're not kids anymore.

00:02:20.630 --> 00:02:21.480
I mean what did you think?

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:23.070
We're just gonna sit
in my basement all day,

00:02:23.070 --> 00:02:24.540
play games for the rest of our lives?

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:27.610
- It is important to
me that you feel safe,

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:29.260
like this can still be your home.

00:02:30.840 --> 00:02:31.950
- What do we do when we reach

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:34.580
the place where we don't know what to do?

00:02:34.580 --> 00:02:36.140
- We're gonna get each other through this.

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:37.810
- Don't focus on what you can't fix.

00:02:37.810 --> 00:02:39.090
Focus on what you can.

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:40.573
- What is it you really want?

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:42.253
- Ice cream.

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:45.965
And Justice.

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:47.948
- Is my mom here?

00:02:47.948 --> 00:02:49.400
- It's just us.

00:02:49.400 --> 00:02:51.180
You and us.

00:02:51.180 --> 00:02:52.255
- Guilty.

00:02:52.255 --> 00:02:53.720
- I can't believe it's like this.

00:02:53.720 --> 00:02:55.270
- Whatever way they ever do us.

00:02:58.880 --> 00:03:00.190
- You wanna cook Crystal meth?

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:02.890
You know the business
- And I know the chemistry.

00:03:02.890 --> 00:03:05.340
- Let's start with some tough love.

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:08.060
You two suck at pedaling meth.

00:03:08.060 --> 00:03:09.370
- Secretary you need
to put the phone down.

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:10.390
- Mike, what the hell's going on?

00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:12.170
- I said put the phone down!

00:03:12.170 --> 00:03:13.750
- Capital's been attacked.

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:17.000
- Sir you are now the
president of the United States.

00:03:17.000 --> 00:03:19.000
- Maybe you wanna calm down
before you go in there.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:19.980
- I'm calm

00:03:19.980 --> 00:03:21.780
I am tired of you people always telling me

00:03:21.780 --> 00:03:23.760
my hands are tied.

00:03:23.760 --> 00:03:25.530
- You feel you need to kill somebody.

00:03:25.530 --> 00:03:27.040
- You don't get to make that call.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:29.170
- I've been making that
call since you know me.

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:31.150
- Everything I've lost is because of you.

00:03:31.150 --> 00:03:33.460
My home, my family, my life.

00:03:33.460 --> 00:03:35.150
- You are a good kid.

00:03:35.150 --> 00:03:38.440
You got manipulated by a mobster.

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:41.920
- But you do not deserve
to be framed for murder.

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:43.590
- We'll be going behind enemy lines,

00:03:43.590 --> 00:03:46.180
outnumbered, open to
attack from all directions

00:03:46.180 --> 00:03:47.740
and risking another gang war.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:49.990
- It's unclear what
exactly caused the events

00:03:53.240 --> 00:03:54.670
Maybe we can save them.

00:04:06.855 --> 00:04:09.329
- Did I bend this war between us?

00:04:09.329 --> 00:04:11.400
- We are out of our league.

00:04:11.400 --> 00:04:15.570
- We don't get to decide
who lives and who dies.

00:04:15.570 --> 00:04:16.870
- We're getting out and everyone of you

00:04:16.870 --> 00:04:18.360
is crucial to that plan.

00:04:18.360 --> 00:04:19.510
When those lights go black,

00:04:19.510 --> 00:04:22.640
we're gonna disappear from
this place light ghosts.

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:25.340
- Hey there, I'm Ashley
two, what's your name?

00:04:25.340 --> 00:04:26.440
- Everywhere you look!

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:30.910
- And there's more.

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:33.397
Ashley eternal is dreamable.

00:04:35.567 --> 00:04:37.273
- I'm not ready to be Saarc.

00:04:37.273 --> 00:04:39.030
- You were born for this.

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:41.523
Trust yourself, God chose you.

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.223
Divine bloody right.

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:53.510
- Wildlife still flourishes
in astonishing numbers

00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:56.063
in a few precious places.

00:04:58.700 --> 00:05:02.170
We'll explore the planet's
most important habitats

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:06.770
and celebrate the life they still support.

00:05:25.495 --> 00:05:26.995
- You'll spoil it.

